==Notes==

*Added in the [[expansion pack]]s.
*Many players think the [[tumble]] skill is a better way to avoid these attacks of opportunity, because it also provides an [[armor class]] bonus. However, this feat can be useful for those who do not have the [[skill point]]s to spare or who have a high [[armor check penalty]].
* This ability is useful for positioning oneself for a more successful whirlwind attack.